{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手陳凱詠（Jace）首登西九爵士音樂節，兩場演出全場爆滿，Jace今次聯同香港結他手及作曲家張駿豪（Teriver Cheung）參與音樂節。</p><p>演出於昨日（21日）圓滿結束。</p><p>兩位音樂人將爵士與流行樂完美融合。</p><p>Jace在台上傾情演繹多首經爵士</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:43:50.994981+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:37:14.209996+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:37:14.209996+00:00","content_hash":"17ee0c6bdc71513cc467f1e2ff2d2380e159b2e81aa8d558f85231bf866dd03c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}